---
description: Lumen project rules for Cursor's agent
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before making changes and follow it. The short version:

- Never push to `main`; work on a branch and open a PR.
- Before saying you're done, run `cd server && python -m pytest -q` and `cd web && npm run build`.
- The alert JSON in `docs/agent-line.md` is a contract; don't change it unless asked.
- No LLM decides whether a safety alert fires. No face recognition of strangers. No live video leaves a phone.
- Captions and alerts stay large, plain and high contrast. Black/gray/white design; the Eclipse logo is the only color.
- Never use `sudo` or reinstall `torch` on the AMD box. Never commit API keys.
- Keep changes small and explain them in plain words.
